      "comment": "BOY BLUE NZ (7) is a talented gelding first up from a break of 12 weeks who generally comes to hand quickly. The driver has some work to do from this wide starting position. Makes plenty of appeal in this most suitable assignment. MAGIC CAPTAIN (8) has been hard to fault of late and he made it two in a row when successful at his latest appearance over 2130m at this track, getting home by 1.5 metres. Must overcome a very wide draw. Good enough to put himself in the winners' stall again. MIKIS PRIDE (6) is looming as a real threat after a better effort last start, finishing third at this track over 2130m. OVERLY EXCITED (11) is in the mix following a fourth at his most recent appearance over 2130m at this track.",
